    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d30">

                <pb facs="0167" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg47"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A4a/15</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Italian Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Ricci</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-02-06"><hi rendition="#italic">February 6,
                        1922</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 457</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: I have not failed to
                    report in due course to His Excellency the Royal Minister of Foreign Affairs the
                    courteous answer returned to me by Your Excellency<anchor n="44" xml:id="d30-f1"
                    /> on the subject of the desired accession of Italy to the covenant about the
                    Pacific between the United States of America, the British Empire, France and
                    Japan.</p>
                <p>Marquis Torretta now instructs me to say to your Excellency that he has taken
                    note of the declaration made by Your Excellency and taken it in the sense that
                    the United States will not oppose the Italian request when it shall have
                    obtained the assent of the other three Governments which signed the Pacific
                    Treaty.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">V. Rolandi Ricci</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d30-f1" n="44" xml:id="d30-f1-content">
                <p>Apparently reference is made to an oral statement.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
